  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fourth Annual Eitan Run</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Eitan - Everybody Can!&quot; is a nonprofit organization dedicated to the empowerment and integration of people with special needs, through professional fitness training.  On April 1st, 2022, in Tel Aviv, we will launch the fourth annual &quot;Eitan Run&quot; . This non-competitive race will bring Eitan trainees, trainers and volunteers, from all over Israel, to run together in a show of solidarity and inclusion.  Please consider sponsoring the runners!</narrative>
  </description>
